{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "healthcare-api-collection",
    "name": "Healthcare API - Complete Testing Suite",
    "description": "Comprehensive API collection for Healthcare project with all endpoints and authentication requirements. IMPORTANT: See notes for authentication requirements and limitations.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "✅ API FIXED - AUTHENTICATION REQUIREMENTS",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "API Documentation & Security",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [""]
            },
            "description": "📋 AUTHENTICATION REQUIREMENTS (UPDATED):\n\n✅ OPEN ENDPOINTS (No auth required):\n- POST /auth/register - Register new patient\n- POST /auth/login - Login user\n- GET /specialties - Get all specialties (PUBLIC)\n\n🔐 AUTHENTICATED ENDPOINTS:\n- GET /doctors - Requires ANY authentication (checkAuth())\n\n🔐 ADMIN/DOCTOR ONLY:\n- POST /specialties - Requires ADMIN or DOCTOR role\n\n🔐 ADMIN ONLY:\n- DELETE /specialties/:id - Requires ADMIN role\n- POST /users/create-doctor - Requires ADMIN role\n\n✅ FIXES APPLIED:\n1. ✓ Created proper Specialty interface (title, description?, icon?)\n2. ✓ Specialty service now uses ICreateSpecialtyPayload type\n3. ✓ POST /specialties now requires ADMIN/DOCTOR role\n4. ✓ DELETE /specialties now requires ADMIN role\n5. ✓ POST /users/create-doctor now requires ADMIN role\n6. ✓ GET /specialties is now PUBLIC\n7. ✓ Optional fields in Create Doctor interface (profilePhoto, contactNumber, address, currentWorkingPlace)\n8. ✓ GET /doctors requires authentication\n9. ✓ Removed unused imports\n\n📝 NOTES:\n- Gender enum values: MALE, FEMALE, OTHER\n- registrationNumber must be unique\n- All timestamps (createdAt, updatedAt) are auto-generated\n- All IDs are auto-generated with uuid()"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "Public authentication endpoints - no authentication required",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Patient",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.accessToken) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('accessToken', jsonData.data.accessToken);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.refreshToken) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('refreshToken', jsonData.data.refreshToken);",
                  "    }",
                  "    console.log('Patient registered. Response:', JSON.stringify(jsonData.data, null, 2));",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('Registration failed:', pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Patient\",\n  \"email\": \"john.patient@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePassword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new patient account.\n\nResponse includes:\n- accessToken (stored in environment)\n- refreshToken (stored in environment)\n- patient data\n- user data from auth service\n\nNote: Currently token field may be undefined in response"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.accessToken) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('accessToken', jsonData.data.accessToken);",
                  "    }",
                  "    if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.refreshToken) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('refreshToken', jsonData.data.refreshToken);",
                  "    }",
                  "    console.log('Login successful. Response:', JSON.stringify(jsonData.data, null, 2));",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('Login failed:', pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john.patient@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePassword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login user with email and password.\n\nResponse includes:\n- accessToken (stored in environment)\n- refreshToken (stored in environment)\n- User data from auth service\n\nTokens are automatically set as cookies and stored in environment variables"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Specialties",
      "description": "Medical specialties management. WARNING: POST and DELETE lack authentication middleware",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Specialty (ADMIN/DOCTOR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Cardiology\",\n  \"description\": \"Heart and cardiovascular system diseases\",\n  \"icon\": \"heart-icon\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/specialties",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["specialties"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new medical specialty.\n\n🔐 AUTHENTICATION REQUIRED: ADMIN or DOCTOR role\n\nRequired fields:\n- title (string, unique)\n\nOptional fields:\n- description (string)\n- icon (string)\n\n✅ FIXED:\n- Service now uses ICreateSpecialtyPayload interface\n- Only accepts title, description, and icon (not full Specialty type)\n- Requires proper authentication"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Specialties (PUBLIC)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    var specialties = jsonData.data;",
                  "    if (specialties && specialties.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('specialtyId', specialties[0].id);",
                  "        console.log('First specialty ID set:', specialties[0].id);",
                  "    }",
                  "    console.log('Specialties fetched:', specialties.length);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/specialties",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["specialties"]
            },
            "description": "Fetch all available medical specialties.\n\n✅ NO AUTHENTICATION REQUIRED (Public endpoint)\n\nAutomatic behavior:\n- First specialty ID is saved to environment for use in other requests\n- Can be accessed by anyone without login"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Specialty (ADMIN only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/specialties/{{specialtyId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["specialties", "{{specialtyId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Delete a medical specialty by ID."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
